1.CZ6 Device target spec. (Tj=27C)

  Ln=0.54+/-0.04um Ionn= 4.30mA  Vtn= 0.65+/-0.10V  
  Lp=0.54+/-0.04um Ionp=-2.20mA  Vtp=-0.80+/-0.15V

  Tox=155+/-10A           

          @Ion equals to IDS/5 for VDS=VGS=5V, W=50um.
          @Vt equals to Vgs for VDS=5V, IDS=1uA, W=50um.

2.Model name

   nch model name = n
   pch model name = p

3.Model spec.

 (1)Typical case

  .LIB NT
  Ln=0.54um  Ionn= 4.30mA  Vtn= 0.65V  Tox=155A
  .LIB PT
  Lp=0.54um  Ionp=-2.20mA  Vtp=-0.80V  Tox=155A

 (2)Fast case

  .LIB NF
  Ln=0.50um  Ionn= 4.68mA  Vtn= 0.55V  Tox=145A
  .LIB PF
  Lp=0.50um  Ionp=-2.55mA  Vtp=-0.65V  Tox=145A

 (3)Slow case

  .LIB NS
  Ln=0.58um  Ionn= 3.93mA  Vtn= 0.75V  Tox=165A
  .LIB PS
  Lp=0.58um  Ionp=-1.87mA  Vtp=-0.95V  Tox=165A

 (4)Nch Fast - Pch Slow  case

  .LIB NTF
  Ln=0.54um  Ionn= 4.48mA  Vtn= 0.55V  Tox=155A
  .LIB PTS
  Lp=0.54um  Ionp=-2.04mA  Vtp=-0.95V  Tox=155A

 (5)Nch Slow - Pch Fast  case

  .LIB NTS
  Ln=0.54um  Ionn= 4.11mA  Vtn= 0.75V  Tox=155A
  .LIB PTF
  Lp=0.54um  Ionp=-2.36mA  Vtp=-0.65V  Tox=155A

4. 
  Perimeter of the drain and source junctions including the channel edge
 shuld be always assigned by PD and PS in the net list as shown below.
 
        PD=2W+2D
                                       ____Poly
                                       |  |
                            ___________|  |___________
                           |           |  |           |
                           |           |  |           |
                           |           |  |           |
                         W |    drain  |  |   source  |
                           |           |  |           |
                           |___________|  |___________|Diff
                                 D     |  |
                                       |  |
                                       ~  ~ 
                          
5.
  Area of the drain and source junctions shuld be always assigned
 by AD and AS in the net list as shown below.

        AD=W*D

6. 
  Wmin is 0.8um in SPICE model parameter, but in SPICE simulation, the 
  minimum of w in netlist is 0.9um.
                          



